The original authors and modification credits are preserved in the C source.
Changes made for this binding isolate its Tcl package, commands, status array,
handle prefixes and object types, and use OceanBase Connector/C TLS options
to require certificate and host verification without plaintext fallback.
Only the Tcl
loading entry points are exported from the shared object.

This directory does not contain OceanBase Connector/C or a copy of its source.
It builds against an independently installed SDK and dynamically links
libobclnt. That library and its dependencies retain their own licenses.
Redistributing them requires their corresponding licenses, notices and source
arrangements; this binding's COPYING file does not replace those materials.

Tcl 9 stubs are linked into the binding. The Tcl license is included in COPYING.
